{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026swTeasc80X1793466642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[01:57]</p><p>口岸通網頁顯示：新皇崗口岸出境輪候時間回復正常。</p><p></p><p>[01:25]</p><p>入境處：皇崗口岸出境人流相當繁忙，盡量凌晨兩點前改用深圳灣口岸。</p><p></p><p>[01:15]</p><p>新皇崗口岸交通開始繁忙，警方：往落客區車輛預計需在附近等約15至30分鐘。</p><p></p><p>午夜後，皇崗口岸出境人流明顯增加，口岸通網頁顯示，出境輪候時間為繁忙，其中訪港旅客須等候45分鐘。</p><p></p><p>出境大堂，不少內地旅客過關，亦有人身穿萬聖節裝束，相信是慶祝完萬聖節後返回內地。「E-道」閘機全部開放，每條隊都有約30人輪候。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iqUESiMU2V1793466772.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>皇崗口岸提供24小時服務，通往口岸的巴士已加密班次，而深圳灣口岸亦會延長服務兩小時，至凌晨2時。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ulo3RsJQ0K1793466782.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.702703+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T17:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:11.446324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:11.446324+00:00","content_hash":"f9da2f685f8027454b8c4c5f862e5067f6762ae45a9636aa4ddb8b4b202c2412","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}